Comment: 9,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,TO BE CONTINUED
Comment: 9,0:23:29.35,0:23:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Green Dolphin Street Prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.65,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nicknamed "The Aquarium".{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.74,0:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In its time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.51,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it gave birth\Nto mystery and power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.97,0:00:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A power invisible\Nto ordinary men.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.19,0:00:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A power and a mystery\Nsteeped in filth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.59,0:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jolyne was sentenced{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.07,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to five additional years in a punitive\Nward for her escape attempt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.76,0:00:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will all begin after her release.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.01,0:00:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.52,0:00:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before that,\NI must look into something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.25,0:00:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It concerns another inmate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.98,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her name is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hermes Costello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.99,0:00:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jolyne has already met her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.83,0:01:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you, scum!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The infirmary?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:12.39,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I end up here?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.59,0:02:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:51.97,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guy who cleans the toilets.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.14,0:02:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked my ass off for that money.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember now.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:01.61,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut myself\Nin the palm of my right hand.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:05.29,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a fever, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But my hand\Nis almost fully healed.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I dreaming?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.93,0:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just before I arrived here{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:18.89,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to serve my five-year sentence\Nfor my robbery,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.08,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I found an amulet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.98,0:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was in the laundry room\Nof the holding prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.19,0:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cut myself on it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:31.57,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it pissed me off and I sold it to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:34.65,0:03:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was her name again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.92,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right, Gwess.\NAnyway, I sold her the amulet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that night...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}something made me pass out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.67,0:03:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since then, I've been here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.54,0:03:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have I been bedridden this whole time?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand feels better.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.27,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just peeled\Nthat sticker off my hand.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my memory playing tricks on me?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.02,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The year 1492.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Christopher Columbus discovers America.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.28,0:04:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugs Bunny's birthday\Nis July 27th.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my memory works fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I already peeled it off.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.03,0:04:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what? My shoes...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There are...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.17,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,three, four, five, six...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There are five? They merged!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.65,0:04:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the heat making me lose it?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about the sticker?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one I threw away...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:59.82,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gross!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:04.74,0:05:07.70,TiretsDefault,,681,0,0,,– You're making a racket!\N– Keep it down, will you?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.99,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.01,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The heat has nothing to do with it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.85,0:05:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm holding this shoe,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.76,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel its weight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.81,0:05:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The sticker...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,when I attach it to an object,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that object gets duplicated.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.85,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I remove it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.93,0:05:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}something gets destroyed\Nand the original object is restored.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This sticker...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.49,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know it sounds crazy,\Nbut there's no doubt about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It came out of my hand!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,now that I've accepted it,\Nit's actually really useful.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.45,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is amazing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No need to strain my brain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sticker comes out of my hand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's reality.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my money.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.53,0:06:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.12,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.37,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't notice a thing.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I grabbed it without thinking.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.96,0:06:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This disc...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.76,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it do?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.93,0:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your temperature is normal.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.85,0:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to your cell.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.02,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I have a question.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:53.59,0:06:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who cleans the toilets,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.58,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,is he a model prisoner? What...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would you do with that information?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The inmate who does the cleaning?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not a CD,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it has the same shape{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it reflects light\Nthe same way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.34,0:07:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's soft and elastic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.76,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I saw another disc on his face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.84,0:07:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There were two things like that\Non his face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.52,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?\NIt's projecting something.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:35.81,0:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The money I took\Nfrom the sick inmates.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's mine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five thousand dollars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:43.28,0:07:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one will ever find it here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.32,0:07:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This image...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:51.24,0:07:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}McQueen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would you cooperate with me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as my associate?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.75,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}McQueen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just see?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like I was looking\Ninto someone else's memory!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been asking questions about me.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've stalked people before,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've never been stalked\Nby a woman before.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a first.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.32,0:08:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.65,0:08:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw
Dialogue: 9,0:08:26.03,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,discs coming out of your face!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.33,0:08:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything. What discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a loser!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.80,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you yelling all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.18,0:08:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole my money at the infirmary.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.14,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This very morning!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Money? Now that you mention it.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:55.81,0:08:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a huge amount of money,\Nwhich I hid somewhere.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot where!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you screwing with me?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me\Nif I was feeling okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:11.78,0:09:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet of you!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:14.16,0:09:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long\Nsince I last talked with a woman!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, actually it's the first time.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.75,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had\Na sincere conversation with a woman before.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.51,0:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over the moon.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.76,0:09:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope someday I can live\Nwith a wonderful woman like you.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:35.76,0:09:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that will never happen.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pathetic, aren't I?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a piece of trash.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to die.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.65,0:09:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.23,0:09:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:56.29,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.05,0:10:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}McQueen...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pure evil resides within you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:14.26,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You mean no harm to anyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.10,0:10:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You believe you're not a burden to others.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.02,0:10:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see yourself as a victim,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you never give anything back,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.19,0:10:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yet you always hope\Nthat someone will save you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.57,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is precisely why\Nyou are the worst.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You drag others down with you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:38.50,0:10:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are the purest form of evil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really love you, McQueen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.67,0:10:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you ever came across my enemies\Ninside the walls of this prison,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:49.13,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure you would clean them out\Nand take care of them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it! When he hangs himself,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I end up hanged too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:04.52,0:11:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somebody!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm fading.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:09.90,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If his body was lowered,\Nwould I be able to breathe?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.11,0:11:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticker.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has strange powers, just like me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I'm not the only one!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.55,0:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.47,0:11:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hang yourself?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:39.89,0:11:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:42.81,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.94,0:11:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have a power!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:51.61,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A power?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:52.82,0:11:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.65,0:11:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But rest assured,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it again.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see things clearly now.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.41,0:12:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in your debt,\Nyou saved my life.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll return the favor.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.67,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, don't worry.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those scars...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's suicidal!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.23,0:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He isn't even aware of his power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.15,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This sucks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm even\Nin the same position as him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:36.57,0:12:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it, he's so far away from me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.54,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You big bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.54,0:12:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.55,0:12:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The disc!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.72,0:13:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't understand anything\Nof what's going on,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it must have something\Nto do with these discs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.72,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me die.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.39,0:13:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you\NI'd return the favor,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:09.48,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but a guy like me\Nwill never be able to do that,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm a piece of shit!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.15,0:13:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, or I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.41,0:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind being killed\Nby a beautiful woman like you!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.58,0:13:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she picked up a disc\Nin the toilets.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.09,0:13:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why,\Nbut I think it belonged to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'll give it back to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:45.39,0:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, probably not.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a pass.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.23,0:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading back to the women's prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.52,0:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn son of a...!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.17,0:14:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stay as far away\Nas possible from that lunatic.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get back
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.30,0:14:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to my cell.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power has awakened.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that this power of yours
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.76,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is called a Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stands attract one another
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as if they gravitated\Naround one another.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Without any logic.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.93,0:14:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you ran into\Nthat janitor.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.19,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid, here?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:37.11,0:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked up and sold\NJolyne's amulet.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.94,0:14:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she asked me\Nto protect you.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:46.58,0:14:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Jolyne?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.54,0:14:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy has the ability\Nto steal souls.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.63,0:14:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for a soul he stole.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.09,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stolen?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know anything,\Nplease tell me.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A soul?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.14,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be talking\Nabout that disc, by any chance?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.69,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That disc!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It belonged to the janitor.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so important about these discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he have two of them?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.32,0:15:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Two discs? That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A memory disc and a Stand disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.91,0:15:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The discs work in pairs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.87,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two discs make up a soul.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.36,0:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could get the other disc,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.45,0:15:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,we could learn more\Nabout Whitesnake!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, no.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still following me.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I thought I'd gotten far enough away.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:49.39,0:15:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Electricity! That bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's electrocuting himself!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the resistance.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.03,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A man doesn't die\Nfrom a measly 100 volts.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.16,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies have resistance.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.43,0:16:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it stopped.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His suicide attempt failed.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.67,0:16:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:18.42,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,if he wants to try\Nelectrocuting himself again,
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.34,0:16:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he must be out looking\Nfor a saline solution right now.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:25.42,0:16:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A saline solution doubles conductivity\Nand therefore lowers resistance.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.68,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric current will pass through the heart,\Nburning the organ!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A saline solution, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's used in IV drips\Nand as a disinfectant.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.19,0:16:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty at the infirmary!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go any farther.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:42.81,0:16:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many inmates\Nnear the stairs!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:47.12,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna smash his face\Nand take the other disc from him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.66,0:16:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No other choice!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my arm!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.42,0:17:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burned, just like yours.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gained a power.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.81,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of your suicide attempts\Nshows up on me!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.89,0:17:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to kill yourself.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:21.79,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Life can be pretty good.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.78,0:17:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years ago,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was doing some cleaning.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.20,0:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was inspecting my firearm\Nin my apartment.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:40.33,0:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some reason,\Nit was loaded.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.54,0:17:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was an accident.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.59,0:17:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I live on the tenth floor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.76,0:17:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right as the shot went off,\Na woman jumped out of a window.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like the lottery.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:56.85,0:17:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people win millions.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.15,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the opposite\Nhappens.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.15,0:18:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She was supposed to die\Nby smashing her head on the ground.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:07.11,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone believed\NI had targeted and killed her from the 11th floor.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.20,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To the judge,\NI was a "merciless killer".
Dialogue: 9,0:18:16.07,0:18:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me, damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:18.37,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.79,0:18:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Panties.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Has a woman\Never given you her panties?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:23.34,0:18:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'd be lucky\Nif a girl gave you her panties?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at rock bottom right now.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.51,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But imagine.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.97,0:18:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If a girl gives you her panties,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.93,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you become lucky\Neven when your life looks like crap.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.23,0:18:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're going to get them.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you\Nthe ones I'm wearing right now!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your panties?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.78,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep my promises.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember this:
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.70,0:18:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody hates Mondays.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.12,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We all wait for Saturday\Nto come so we can have fun.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Monday every day!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was arrested on a Saturday.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.21,0:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking nonsense\Nto give me hope,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.63,0:19:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but I bet you're bluffing\Nto save your own skin.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretending to be nice
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.52,0:19:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to get yourself out of this situation.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.52,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't believe a word\Nof what you're saying.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.36,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how\Neveryone treats me.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.03,0:19:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes trash.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm worse than trash.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody looks at me.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.79,0:19:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my life!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:44.46,0:19:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true,\NI'm sweet-talking you because I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.88,0:19:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake is using you.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.72,0:19:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's exploiting your weakness.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you weren't trying to kill yourself,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,none of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:01.35,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one being selfish right now,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.77,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a good person.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.57,0:20:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words were sincere.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.56,0:20:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I stumbled by chance\Nupon such a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can die with you...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.13,0:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can spend eternity with you,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:34.63,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,then I am blessed!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:38.47,0:20:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a piece of trash.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.43,0:20:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is, without a doubt,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.60,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}rotten to the core!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.06,0:20:55.19,TiretsDefault,,536,0,0,,– There we go!\N– Let go of that switch, you bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.62,0:21:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was close.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:06.95,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goddamn son of a...!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I managed to stick the sticker on him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:11.67,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The electricity is burning it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:14.63,0:21:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once it's completely burned up,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.76,0:21:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the copy he made...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.43,0:21:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}will be destroyed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:31.98,0:21:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Holy freaking hell.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:34.15,0:21:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:37.11,0:21:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He hid the money he stole,\N$5,000.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:41.70,0:21:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be cashing in on that, you little shit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.99,0:21:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then there's Whitesnake.{\i0}
